  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the jasmine rice until water runs clear and set aside.",
    "In a large pot, combine the rice, smoked paprika, carrot, green beans, and vegetable broth; bring to a boil over medium-high heat.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the coconut milk, soy sauce, diced chicken, salt, and black pepper; return to a gentle simmer.",
    "Cook for an additional 10 minutes, uncovered, until the rice is tender and liquid is absorbed.",
    "Remove from heat and let the stew rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro before serving."
